{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2023-04-19 18:32:00', 'title': 'NRG ENERGY, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NRG ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NRG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK OF $0.3775 PER SHARE, OR $1.51 PER SHARE ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MAY 15, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 1, 2023. ABOUT NRG NRG ENERGY IS A LEADING ENERGY AND HOME SERVICES COMPANY POWERED BY PEOPLE AND OUR PASSION FOR A SMARTER, CLEANER, AND MORE CONNECTED FUTURE."}